---
Put back what a run did, on every member

Usage: tungstate sync undo [OPTIONS] <NAME>

Arguments:
  <NAME>  The sync

Options:
      --last <N>   Put back the last N runs, newest first. Defaults to 1
      --plan <ID>  Put back one run by id, as `sync run` reported it
      --json       
  -h, --help       Print help
